        "instruction": {
          "title": "Lone Pairs and Bond Angles",
          "description": "Water has 2 bonding pairs and 2 lone pairs. Notice how the lone pairs push the bonding pairs closer, resulting in a 104.5 degree bond angle. Click to continue."
        },
